{{/* VerificationSummaryReport — a Document reporting verification
     component by component. provenance-ddf DES-0031: the type extends
     Document, so this template is laid over templates/Document.tmpl, and
     holds only {{define}}s filling the blocks Document.tmpl declares.
     Everything else on the page (heading, status, body, references) is
     Document's.

     - .scope is a query field: the components the report's query selects,
       each with its fields and links like any linked entity. queryof
       gives the query as written.
     - "before-body" states the scope before the prose: the components and
       the query that selected them, and the build the report summarises
       when it names one (.build, which its query reads as ^^build).
     - "after-body" gives each component in scope a section through the
       named template requirements-of-component, which gives each of its
       subcomponents a subsection the same way, down the component tree.
       A section is a query block written here and run by markdown, so
       the component is embedded as a query block embeds a result:
       its headings nest under the heading before it, and Provenance
       numbers them. No grouping is built into Provenance: the tree is the
       component's parent links, and the nesting is embedding. */}}
{{define "before-body"}}
<section class="report-scope">
<p>This report covers {{range $i, $c := .scope}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{link $c}} {{title $c}}{{end}} and the components under {{if eq (len .scope) 1}}it{{else}}them{{end}}, selected by:</p>
<pre class="query"><code>{{queryof . "scope"}}</code></pre>
{{- with .build}}
<p class="report-build">Build summarised: {{link .}} {{title .}}, {{.version}}.</p>
{{- end}}
</section>
{{end}}
{{define "after-body"}}
<section class="report-components">
<h2>Verification by component</h2>
{{- range .scope}}
{{markdown (printf "```query\nfrom: Component\nwhere:\n  field: id\n  operator: equals\n  value: %s\ntemplate: requirements-of-component\n```\n" .ID)}}
{{- end}}
</section>
{{end}}
